WEBVTT

00:16:00.871 --> 00:16:05.454
I won't say always, but but I mean, the
most aggressive one we've ever had,

00:16:05.746 --> 00:16:08.496
Humphrey. He only lasted
one and a half years.

00:16:09.287 --> 00:16:11.412
I'm really interested in
hearing your take on

00:16:11.621 --> 00:16:13.329
the mechanisms behind this pattern.

00:16:14.037 --> 00:16:17.496
So if they're if they're really aggressive
, chimps don't last as long.

00:16:17.829 --> 00:16:19.537
How do you explain that? What
do you think is driving it?

00:16:20.246 --> 00:16:24.662
I don't know. I mean, it's just that they
all have different personalities.

00:16:25.246 --> 00:16:30.996
And I suppose the aggressive ones don't
necessarily use their brains.